{"description":"React to a message in a conversation with one emoji (D-331), or take your reaction back. Without message_id it reacts to the bot's latest reply. One reaction per person per message: another emoji replaces yours. The bot sees it the next time it works in that chat; a \ud83d\udc4d or \ud83d\udc4e tells it whether the reply worked.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"bot":{"description":"Bot name or id","type":"string"},"conversation_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"emoji":{"description":"Exactly one emoji, e.g. \ud83d\udc4d","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"message_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"remove":{"description":"Take your reaction back instead","type":"boolean"},"workspace":{"type":"string"}},"required":["bot","conversation_id","emoji"],"type":"object"},"name":"react_to_message","title":"React to a message"}
